  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in a large saucepan over medium-low heat.",
    "Add the onion, garlic, carrot, and celery, and cook until the vegetables are tender, about 10 minutes.",
    "Add the soya beans, bouillon, and flour. Bring to a simmer, then reduce the heat to low and cook for 10 minutes.",
    "Meanwhile, prepare the mashed potatoes according to package instructions.",
    "To assemble the dish, place a portion of the mashed potatoes in a serving vessel made of wood, then spoon the soya bean mixture over the top.",
